  "bodyHash": "76f1720ab2757946",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>這是一個允許你在Minecraft中使用唱機來聆聽特攝片頭曲(OP)與片尾曲(ED)的模組！</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1066377/description_80d7e72b-682a-4e75-9b91-46903b56caa3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1066377/description_d5db753b-21da-4f74-bd3b-de35effbe077.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"669\" height=\"415\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">它將持續更新特攝OP與ED。</span></h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>你甚至可以收聽最新的奧特曼亞克(OP)。</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bfe8da56-a848-457c-a702-68ff923aabd4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#3598db;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>你可以在開採時發現這些礦物。</strong></span></span></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1066377/description_908713bb-030f-411f-941e-5c631a6bb77f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#3598db\">接著使用它們來合成你想要的唱片。</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1066377/description_f13f86a8-d9d2-49af-9832-209c7fb20f10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"528\" height=\"269\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#3598db\">你也可以透過幸運袋獲得唱片。</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1066377/description_0bd6ea00-3428-468f-be71-598eb3b1a5b6.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">感謝遊玩我的模組！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">我第一次製作模組純粹是因為我十分熱愛Minecraft與特攝。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">祝遊玩愉快。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\">本模組所用音樂之版權皆歸原著作權方所有。</span></strong></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
